## 📈 Key Business Questions

| Analysis | Business Purpose |
|---|---|
| Top 25 Profitable Orders | Identify the orders generating the highest profit |
| Profit by Day of Week | Understand profitability patterns throughout the week |
| Profit by Category and Region | Compare product and regional performance |
| Profit by Subcategory | Identify the strongest profit contributors within each category |
| Regional Order Counts | Support regional sales activity monitoring |

